        "original_id": "8b1760e8-e0d0-50e3-a27d-885149ecd6b5",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Bill Pullman, Sandra Bullock, Peter Gallagher, Peter Boyle, Glynis Johns, Jack Warden\n- Works: While You Were Sleeping\n- Roles: Lucy, Jack, Peter\n- Organizations: Chicago Transit Authority\n\nFacts:\n- Bill Pullman was born on December 17, 1953, and is an American actor.\n- While You Were Sleeping stars Sandra Bullock as Lucy, a Chicago Transit Authority token collector.\n- While You Were Sleeping stars Bill Pullman as Jack, the brother of the man whose life is saved.\n- While You Were Sleeping stars Peter Gallagher as Peter, the man whose life is saved.\n- While You Were Sleeping also features Peter Boyle and Glynis Johns as members of Peter's family.\n- While You Were Sleeping also features Jack Warden as a longtime family friend and neighbor.",
